Follow AGENTS.md and .specify/memory/constitution.md. Treat generated model documents as evidence about the current tree, not proof that every inventoried capability is on a live execution path.

Before implementing, inspect the relevant service, policy, runtime, evidence sink, event consumer, and tests. Write the regression test first. Preserve tenant boundaries, immutable provenance, bounded execution, explicit authorization, and retry/idempotency guarantees.

Never return synthetic operational metrics or seed production APIs with fictional records. Represent missing integrations explicitly as unavailable. Use Alembic for operational schema changes. Regenerate source-derived docs instead of editing them manually.

Only build public or explicitly authorized source acquisition. Respect source policies, provider terms, rate limits, retention, and authorization.
